      "source_text": "相当出色！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1430a015cf6d701be62b0977a6ac0062cdc6197b67633a5a3581318bf32e33cd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1015",
        "140011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0226e833776732bdc3bf2e92",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "太棒了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9517a20ad976235ecbad39bf2f882bf0c18d7ab52b212109dc5ae86d4580ef47",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1015",
        "140012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:052d905a10aa0ab6297ef99e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "太好了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2deba7ca30c98238317c64bb01282f7578b945b19432461c4536c6681ac4b8ee",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1015",
        "140013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c869e331a4c317b99cfbf8c4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔唔……",
      "source_fingerprint": "1dfb96d163733959e5250b066fab803d16c85e8be2ca2413aca9f44e91be5c0d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1015",
        "140014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:baee7429e2e60095d0745e6c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "喔喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3698f7bf45bf8f30b355ffabce5c3240f1ec7b1ee583961830a0bde53969ac1a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1015",
        "140015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:392bb7e120de55512074b454",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "来吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "259094e5a27d8b74ef6c993df596f92eace76ba061f4116e7799ac4847d895f0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1015",
        "140016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ff222786cd0d7f601d9c13c1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔……",
      "source_fingerprint": "57a4e1df408b325e7498dd0dbd16dfa65e96cd654a4bab6bba7b78f0a47f36a6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1015",
        "140017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5c8545200f85a6fd3ea067b9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4d27fba32b4cdf632760230caaf4b4d14ee3299721f6e4c735d9a42b03bba61e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1015",
        "140018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bae4982a6dcb805d4ed44576",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "明天好像能拿到这个！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a6975cf663d0723fd77a7c75851e609e8cdbdf5d5100ca87706996c84cd7117b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1015",
        "15"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2d3e1afde64ec01df7213682",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "身体动弹不得……！？\r\n唔，我太大意了……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6183f371b1c96fb16606965609130f201b276dbd93b463e36bee64f32b6127b7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1015",
        "20000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4e29904cc6b4d4b1ca57afb1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "迈向荣耀之路就在眼前……\r\n但我却使不上力……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0eb538c742676a16fe58375ae2737519911e62be7d5a3ef472af6551f348a1c3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1015",
        "20001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e55092a2dac75e528c0196d6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哈哈哈哈！\r\n今天的我格外耀眼夺目！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c869e2c41ed6cfd4653a957dde8e9dc03b8d02718531f6fe9a61748c2648f5a8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1015",
        "20002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6028fe4dc648e45af8e80570",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "状况真不错！\r\n要成为绝对的「世纪末霸王」\r\n也只是时间的问题！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7753a720e41e67a1867effab7ba4335f49f960e58caee075ee6f31fa36286774",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1015",
        "20003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4cd3167673ca7147efb30cef",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊啊，我的双脚好轻盈……！\r\n感觉都能像天鹅一样\r\n展翅高飞了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8f849021ed307eb7afa995b95f5466fc7e97c4a965a285b0ed90f4274a09eeaa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1015",
        "20004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:248af6255970ec617729ddf6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "让你在近距离观赏我的光辉吧！\r\n好了，快点快点！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0580025d4866b0a895dc40382709e91bd193301c97c24fdc70a41bf1192f9efa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1015",
        "20005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2f17ae65d301872551583153",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "练习曲的时间到了。\r\n好，我们开始吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2f2314e8d4af3a866ea92c35f80c19b2070b7245c238a02e35873730d4d478ec",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1015",
        "20006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8d97781b9f49f9ac639c73e1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "拜托你\r\n尽量选择美丽的训练哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c1cbdd66430581589b5505de5c6b6caff08a3bc0cbe1695b25177050a71cd566",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1015",
        "20007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4a9a12de2f927550c0f321fd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我觉得\r\n有点倦怠……",
      "source_fingerprint": "80710775b96f025af701f6b90e25b8ffca2bda7c01d6a47a0504f007c1c7b8f6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1015",
        "20008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5b6f4ce110b42df6b4e74751",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "总觉得心情不太……\r\n……不，没事。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f8eef877f13bb7e92f7d6c5385cb176f134a4482a3127635e09d423cc443f5a2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1015",
        "20009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d4f716560608d4d0f83734ee",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我很想告诉你「没问题」，\r\n可是坦白说我全身无力……",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd962a650f5ebe5746c039eb885d287753b4f3b0dffb007fe7c5c8c051414ef2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1015",
        "20010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5b839d70698b5dfbcf49b5ce",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "身为「霸王」，不能在这种地方\r\n驻足不前……这点我心知肚明，\r\n但是……",
      "source_fingerprint": "10652552e748ba8dd704930b6c51ce94e6930cdfc4d197242364134df1c4fc22",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1015",
        "20011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b541498ad80973616f66730e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "又是比赛啊……\r\n要我参加是无妨，\r\n不过你有考虑到之后的事吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "bba8f476a19a9d732b7e59eb38dd056bde09d48be64b91b2790fc9fa05c97e8c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1015",
        "20021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8459fca61c01ffb5d71a6259",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……就算是「霸王」，\r\n接连参加比赛也不妥。\r\n万一我搞坏身体，你也会很伤脑筋吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "bf83e358ff98399fd034b67ac50fe175bd4549e605cbb708b83a3f9592e986ad",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1015",
        "20022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:12d0c785924275803511db0d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊啊，我脑中已经演奏起来了……\r\n赞扬我的胜利开场小号……！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "73c75b0a6a9c7081252ff2cf25575728f5dda10d92ca30977246851f55018b26",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1015",
        "20023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:afb3908306425007a28c6c5f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "以压倒性的力量制服对手……\r\n感觉这场比赛能让「霸王」\r\n发挥出相符的风范！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a2c79a2a0a5b65b5d9310dd70c2400e055fd68154beeddae72bd2ab4ef58d58d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1015",
        "20024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:97d20b684e00a746cb2babfd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要用一句话形容现在的我，\r\n没错……就是完美无缺！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3a126c55fc69e00d24480a324a562a1132d9ebe6707f560cc6a7486f9585800b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1015",
        "20025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2f0e3663157e27adc1048590",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我内心深处\r\n涌现出热情了……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f92cd3ab7f4c5ba08590610c07b8c4feec33f38983e60aa378ab3e826d371146",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1015",
        "20026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:27b56541cbbbe6be2b6e5e14",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "状态该说是\r\n无可挑剔吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f1b82ded07d458b825ba750219d52c167b5783e8147f1903d952c34fc93f5844",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1015",
        "20027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6333233a5307fa97e8b563e5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "状况真不错。让我们去掌握\r\n灿烂的胜利吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "307228f55c643413ea7785c84fef36918989d51306e54d7019010629c21d8b93",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1015",
        "20028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5ec80690ff4afa0107406f3e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "身为「霸王」，\r\n我会抬头挺胸地跑给大家看。",
      "source_fingerprint": "481130cebcd25e80c649a7523f8cdcfe3d69807157797c99058058c29bb70ab7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1015",
        "20029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c84caac036f7a49b0002575c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "首先从行板开始，\r\n再渐渐地迈向高潮。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3af6dd70a05488cd88d605f3e80908a209cfd19461874e46cd0daac2fa312aa5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1015",
        "20030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aa256df3889acfda9e7293b1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你要确实见证我的活跃\r\n到最后一刻啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b7fb24ba7c7c04d1377138d540bcbd60d2dc9c156363dcd0c91270b33ad7aaf3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1015",
        "20031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b8dbaceaef1469234ae36d1b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "加油……加油啊……！\r\n「霸王」好歌剧……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2e4620fcb0ab02ccb6ce9076d963de3334cc7fd2ce960849e227b7ab7ebd3aab",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1015",
        "20032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b3b88732664dc57440afe1b5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "状态不好才正是考验实力的时候……\r\n没关系，就让我来试试看吧。",
